  "title": "Flutterwave Powers Digital Tax Collections for Nigeria’s Federal Inland Revenue Service (FIRS)",
  "summary": "Lagos, Nigeria – 20 March 2025: Africa’s leading payments technology company, Flutterwave, is now enabling digital tax collections for the Federal Inland Revenue Service (FIRS), making it one of the few fintechs supporting the government in modernizing tax payments. This development allows the FIRS to leverage Flutterwave’s seamless and secure payment infrastructure to collect taxes, […]",
